 instead of the number of presidents who were at least 50 years old, as the sample space. Choice D is incorrect and may result from a calculation error.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959623,"updateDate":1691007959623}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959623, 1691007959623),
    ($SATQ$b680e76d$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$09908-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.E.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Probability and conditional probability$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<div xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1" class="stimulus_reference ">
        <div class="passage ">
          <div class="prose style:1 ">
            <p class="passage_para ">A survey taken by 1,000&nbsp;students at a school asked whether they played school sports. The table below summarizes all 1,000 responses from the students surveyed.</p>
          </div>
