e="font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-before-edge;">Temperature</text><text class="ytitle-group-line-1" transform="translate(0, 20)" fill="currentColor" style="font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-before-edge;">  (°F)</text></g></svg><div role="region" aria-label="Long description for scatterplot" class="sr-only"><ul>
<li>The scatterplot has 6 data points.</li>
<li>The data points are in a linear pattern trending down from left to right.</li>
<li>A line of best fit is shown:<br/>
<ul>
<li>The line of best fit slants down from left to right.</li>
<li>The line of best fit passes through the following coordinates:<br/>
