cle cx=\"23.202433268229168\" cy=\"89.35634765625001\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"46.404866536458336\" cy=\"113.90775960286459\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"69.6072998046875\" cy=\"113.90775960286459\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"116.01216634114584\" cy=\"121.27318318684895\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"139.214599609375\" cy=\"145.82459513346353\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"162.41703287760419\" cy=\"143.3694539388021\" r=\"4px\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></g><g class=\"xtitle-group\" transform=\"translate(232.7265625, 263.203125)\"><text class=\"xtitle-group-line-0\" transform=\"translate(0, 0)\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: hanging;\">Distance above sea level (feet)</text></g><g class=\"ytitle-group\" transform=\"translate(47.0625, 118.6015625)\"><text class=\"ytitle-group-line-0\" transform=\"translate(0, 0)\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-before-edge;\">Temperature</text><text class=\"ytitle-group-line-1\" transform=\"translate(0, 20)\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px; text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-before-edge;\">  (°F)</text></g></svg><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for scatterplot\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul>\n<li>The scatterplot has 6 data points.</li>\n<li>The data points are in a linear pattern trending down from left to right.</li>\n<li>A line of best fit is shown:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>The line of best fit slants down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line of best fit passes through the following coordinates:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 47)</li>\n<li>(4,000 comma 35)</li>\n<li>(7,000 comma 26)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">At a distance of <math alttext=\"4,000\"><mn>4,000</mn>\n</math> feet above sea level, what is the temperature, <math alttext=\"in degree upper F\"><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mtext>F</mtext></math>, predicted by the line of best fit?</p>","keys":["7da6f449-c738-4d6b-a59f-ce4ef2d2589e"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"85b010a1-5b53-43d0-b296-59d7aaccc389","content":"<p><math alttext=\"47\"><mn>47</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7da6f449-c738-4d6b-a59f-ce4ef2d2589e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"25cb87de-4907-4f79-b078-feaacbf809b4","content":"<p><math alttext=\"25\"><mn>25</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"fceb29bb-d650-4d7c-b67b-5ab6fed3a567","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. In the given scatterplot, the <em>x</em>-values represent the distance above sea level, in feet, and the <em>y</em>-values represent the temperature, in <math alttext=\"degree upper F\"><mo>&deg;</mo><mtext>F</mtext></math>. The point on the line of best fit with an <em>x</em>-value of <math alttext=\"4,000\"><mn>4,000</mn>\n</math> has a corresponding <em>y</em>-value of <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, at a distance of <math alttext=\"4,000\"><mn>4,000</mn></math> feet above sea level, the temperature predicted by the line of best fit is <math alttext=\"35 degree upper F\"><mn>35</mn><mo>&deg;</mo><mtext>F</mtext></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the temperature, in <math alttext=\"degree upper F\"><mo>&deg;</mo><mtext>F</mtext></math>, predicted by the line of best fit at a distance of <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> feet above sea level.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the measured temperature, in <math alttext=\"degree upper F\"><mo>&deg;</mo><mtext>F</mtext></math>, at a distance of <math alttext=\"6,000\"><mn>6,000</mn></math> feet above sea level.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"be404513-86c1-473f-9573-d0ef7f6ac666","correct_answer":["B"]},"createDate":1743430554986,"updateDate":1743430554986}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554986, 1743430554986),
